"type":"text","text":" sends the request again until its deadline, 23 hours after its oldest"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"record, and Matomo, which removes no duplicates, counts the ones it tracked again. When it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracked none and refused some, as for a site ID of no site, the answer is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations\/ResponseOutcome\/rejected(reason:)"},{"type":"text","text":", so "},{"code":"HTTPDestination","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" drops the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"request and reports it. When it tracked some and refused others, the answer says how many"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"but not which, so the request is delivered, with a notice logged. A body that isn’t such an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"answer, an empty one or one with a negative count included, is delivered."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/matomoencoding\/matomobatchencoder\/outcome(of:for:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/MatomoEncoding\/documentation\/MatomoEncoding\/MatomoBatchEncoder\/outcome(of:for:)"},"abstract":[{"text":"What Matomo’s 2xx answer to ","type":"text"},{"code":"request","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" means: transient when Matomo counted fewer of its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracking requests than were sent, rejected when it refused every one it counted, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"delivered otherwise.","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MatomoEncoding\/documentation\/MatomoEncoding","doc:\/\/MatomoEncoding\/documentation\/MatomoEncoding\/MatomoBatchE